    "Drag to select, then adjust  ·  Hold ⇧ as you let go to capture right away  ·  Esc cancels" : {
      "comment" : "Hint bar before dragging, when a release keeps the selection adjustable",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
