            "value" : "搜索框可按名称查找项目，也可按截屏中的文字查找截屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The search box finds projects by name, and screenshots by their text." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
